            <div xml:id="d513">

                <pb facs="0649" n="547" xml:id="pg547"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/2570: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Great
                        Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Davis</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-12-11T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 11,
                                1919, 5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>6264. Following telegram of December 8, 4 p.m., from Tokyo:</p>
                <p>[Here follows text of telegram printed on <ref target="#pg545">page
                    545</ref>.]</p>
                <p>Department has referred matter to American Group and will advise later decision
                    reached. We are practically recommending acceptance of the suggestion.</p>
                <p>Repeat to Paris as No. 9313.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
